/P 227 0 R
/T (Our review of the AWS environment proved that strong technical infrastructure is easily undermined by loose configuration controls. Leaving root accounts without active Multi-Factor Authentication \(MFA\) and ignoring mandatory data classification metadata tags on S3 storage buckets exposes the bank to catastrophic exposure vectors.)
