/T (Operating in Malaysia means satisfying international ISO 27001 standards is only half the battle. For financial institutions, alignment with BNM RMiT directives means third-party vendor blind spots like missing contractually protected Right-to-Audit clauses on transaction APIs pose immediate operational and legal existential threats.)
